  "description": "Vanilla Rhubarb from the Just Juice Bar Range blends tart, fruity Rhubarb with a soft, creamy Vanilla base. The bright, slightly tangy Rhubarb note hits first, followed by mellow Vanilla that smooths out the sharpness for a dreamy dessert-inspired vape. A layer of Ice provides a clean, frosty finish that rounds out the experience. This nicotine salt e-liquid is formulated at a 60PG/40VG ratio for mouth-to-lung (MTL) devices like pod kits and vape pens. Available in 5mg, 10mg and 20mg strengths, it delivers quick nicotine satisfaction with a smoother, more tactile throat hit than freebase options. Made in the UK, Just Juice Bar Range Nic Salts offer a chilled, flavour-forward vape experience in a compact 10ml format—ideal for fans of sweet-tart profiles with a cool twist. Please Note : All flavours in the Just Juice Bar Range feature a subtle hint of ice to enhance the flavour profile.",
